// Author: Calvin Quint
// GitHub: https://github.com/calvin-quint/docs/blob/main/01-detection-engineering/kql/data-exfiltration/email_attachment_hash_lookup.kql
// Email Attachment Hash Lookup ($hash / $NetworkMessageId lookup template)
// MITRE ATT&CK: N/A — investigation lookup, not a standalone detection
// Detects: Parameterized query to locate every email carrying a given
//          attachment SHA256 and/or NetworkMessageId. Used during incident
//          triage to scope how widely a malicious or leaked attachment
//          circulated, not to trigger on its own.
// Entity mapping: File → Hash → $hash (substitute the value under investigation)
EmailAttachmentInfo
| where SHA256 contains "$hash"
| where NetworkMessageId contains "$NetworkMessageId"
